<Slide notes={`顺着这条链往下走，就能确定回放边界。

最左边是根 Skill 发起世界动作调用，接着 MCP 校验身份、权限和参数。校验通过以后出现 accepted，它只表示动作选择被接受，根 Skill 这一轮就结束了，世界还没有变化。这一步最容易被误读。

再往下才是世界提交，形成真实变化，然后由 StepResult 统一记录本步的状态、事件、效果和会话。往下的持久提交帧与独立校验记录、检查点或恢复快照，才推进可见状态与 committed_step，回放只读这段边界以内的东西。

还有一条也要记住：事件配上非空的结构化载荷，才能确定性重建；而 Thought、计划和临时文本不进入回放归约。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.11.1　一条动作怎样成为可回放事实</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>从动作选择到已提交事实</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 194, height: 150, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>根 Skill 调用</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>world-act</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 150, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 194, height: 150, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>MCP 校验</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>身份 · 权限 · 参数</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 150, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 194, height: 150, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>accepted</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>动作选择被接受{'\n'}根 Skill 本轮结束</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 150, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 194, height: 150, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>World Commit</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>形成真实变化</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 150, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 194, height: 150, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>StepResult</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>统一状态、事件、{'\n'}效果与会话</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#276FBF' }}>↓</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CB6B28' }}>accepted 只是「被接受」；越过持久边界之后的记录，才进入正式回放</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 253, height: 116, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>持久提交帧</Text>
